        "beltRefusalUnderstood": null,
        "jamFairness": 3,
        "notUnderstood": "The columns shift as buckets leave, so my 'column 2' tap missed a few times. Not clear why the blue 1 bucket got refused until the Lane blocked card appeared. The pale pixels looked unfinished and I did not know what they needed. The 'back' badge numbers (2!, 1!) took a while to read.",
