        "freeText": "Both cards appeared right when needed: 'Why it came back' at the start (a bit text heavy, I skimmed it) and 'Lane blocked' the first time my blue bucket was refused; that one helped. Top texts ('Launch first one with no back-arrow: it empties', 'All come back: if it jams, use +1 slot') were clear and not cut. I used the free +1 slot after a jam with 2 pixels to go and won. Nothing new compared to other commercial match-3 though; just a bigger board."
